# APKs

Static analysis of Android APK/XAPK files for security review.

## Tech Stack

- GitHub: `jsmeyers/APKs`
- Tools: `jadx`, `apkanalyzer`, `strings`, custom scripts

## Owner

John

## Status

- Created: 2026-02-20
- Status: active

## Roadmap

- [ ] Verify `jadx` installed (`jadx --version`)
- [ ] Create analysis script template (`scripts/analyze_apk.sh`)
- [ ] Define report format (`report.md` schema)
- [ ] Add samples to `samples/` for testing

## Requirements

- `jadx` (Java decompiler)
- `apkanalyzer` (APK analyzer, part of Android SDK)
- Python 3.x or Bash for scripting

## Output Structure

```
projects/apks/
├── <apk-name>/
│   ├── report.md
│   └── extracted/
└── README.md (this file, aggregates findings)
```
